        <item>
            <title>1.11.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:44:45 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/ramblr</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/ramblr/releases/tag/v1.11.1</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.11.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Pressing the start/stop recording shortcut while paused now safely resumes the in-progress recording instead of ending it.
- The paused menu state now makes Resume Recording the primary action while keeping Stop available as an explicit choice.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nfarina/ramblr/releases/download/v1.11.1/Ramblr-1.11.1-macos.zip" length="3030526" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="j9gUFhkVG5WM4Q5ZPc13DMGL+yLFn8b46sJi8jhHkvxp6T0VCDAxR4bX018op1oQx9chs0lMpFBG8SKfCkuDAw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.11.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:32:47 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/ramblr</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/ramblr/releases/tag/v1.11.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Pause and resume an active recording with the new customizable hotkey, `Option-Z` by default. Paused time is omitted from the audio, and the floating indicator changes to a softly glowing pause icon.
- Pause, resume, stop, or cancel directly from the Ramblr menu while a recording is active.
- The menu content below the status line now scrolls, keeping every setting and recent item accessible on smaller screens.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nfarina/ramblr/releases/download/v1.11.0/Ramblr-1.11.0-macos.zip" length="3028680" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="OQZghys2+EGMbSVuCTApxdig+/zooXTC4OmbEvY4+t8G6IxWSFibAAebv7e5Iz8ji/trvPd1TY+ZRgiFNFSTDw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.10.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 14:10:09 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://nfarina.github.io/ramblr</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/nfarina/ramblr/releases/tag/v1.10.1</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.10.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- Auto-imported Voice Memos now preserve their original recording date and time. Saved transcripts use that timestamp in their date folder and filename, and their filesystem creation and modification dates match the memo as well.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nfarina/ramblr/releases/download/v1.10.1/Ramblr-1.10.1-macos.zip" length="3006832" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="vFbZB0bB79SFES65o71rhAYtCcmAqqFkcmBdlMssqvQLpC/LbyWliTdasB6EwmFuwLJhALGNG+G9RenIxZ1QBw=="/>
